{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB經典長壽劇《真情》至今仍深入民心，近日有網民在社交平台發文，驚覺劇中靈魂人物「好姨」薛家燕，於1996年加入劇組時原來僅得46歲，竟然與現時在台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》中飾演型格經理人「藍鳳儀」的姚子羚同齡！</p><p>強烈的視覺反差隨即引發網民熱議。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T06:33:48.199724+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T05:42:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T06:26:54.146668+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T06:26:54.146668+00:00","content_hash":"9cb4a1f6215e3a18725ba59eda7ffca51bbbe56ea862b807ca73e1c64a3d1c11","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}